---
/**
 * PARENT PARTNERSHIP · WORKSHOPS & WEBINARS — audit §2F.
 *
 * ⚠⚠ THIS PAGE CORRECTS A FABRICATION, AND THE CLIENT NEEDS TO KNOW.
 *
 * data/academics.ts `parents.workshops.cards` describes SIX parent workshops —
 * "Digital safety at home", "Choosing a stream", "Supporting learning at home",
 * "The exam years", "What we teach, and why", "Growing up, and wellbeing" — each
 * with a format ("Webinar · evening", "In person · Classes IX–X") and a list of
 * topic chips. None of the six appears anywhere in the school's published
 * record. They were written for this site.
 *
 * The school DOES run a substantial professional-development programme, and it
 * is documented far better than most: FIFTEEN sessions in data/newsPages.ts,
 * eleven of them naming the trainer, eight naming an institution. But they are
 * run for TEACHERS AND ADMINISTRATORS, not for parents.
 *
 * So this page reports the fifteen truthfully, says plainly who they are for,
 * and states that a parent-facing workshop programme is not published. The six
 * invented cards are still live on the parent-partnership overview page and
 * should be removed there too — flagged to the client separately.
 *
 * ═══ SOURCE — data/newsPages.ts `workshops`, read off the school's own pages ══
 *   CBSE Capacity Building Programme on Experiential Learning — Dr. Pushkal
 *     Giri, Principal, St. Joseph's School, Siwan, and Dr. Ravishankar Mishra,
 *     Vice Principal, Heritage International Public School, Kushinagar.
 *     20–21 September 2025, hosted at Sunbeam Ballia.
 *   Basic Counseling Skills — Mrs. Salony Priya, Founder Director, Ummeed
 *     Counselling & Consulting Services, Kolkata. Two days, 16–17 September,
 *     closing with an assessment and viva.
 *   Critical Thinking — Prof. Pradeep Mishra, Lovely Professional University.
 *   Teacher–Student Bond: Teaching to Mentorship — Mr. Kartik Bajoria.
 *   AI Masterclass — Mr. Sandeep Mukherjee, COO, Sunbeam Group.
 *   EduCarnival 2025, IIT Delhi — four of the school's academic heads attended.
 *   National Education Policy training — delivered BY a Sunbeam Ballia educator
 *     at Sunshine Public School, Ghazipur.
 *
 * ⚠ NOT CLAIMED: that parents may attend any of these; a parent webinar
 * programme; or any session the school has not listed.
 *
 * Composition: statement (ivory, the correction stated plainly) → collage
 * (sand, LEFT — the real record) → close.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/ui/PageHero.astro';
import AcStatement from '../../../components/academics/system/AcStatement.astro';
import AcCollage from '../../../components/academics/system/AcCollage.astro';
import AcClose from '../../../components/academics/system/AcClose.astro';

import banner from '../../../assets/workshops/CriticalThinking/CriticalThinking1.jpg';
import pCritical from '../../../assets/workshops/CriticalThinking/CriticalThinking1.jpg';
import pStory from '../../../assets/workshops/Storytelling-Pedagogy/Storytelling-Pedagogy1.jpg';
import pNep from '../../../assets/workshops/National-Education-Policy/National-Education-Policy-training.jpg';
import pCohort from '../../../assets/photos/sunbeem-3.jpg';

const school = 'Sunbeam School Ballia';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Workshops & Webinars — Sunbeam School Ballia"
  description="Sunbeam School Ballia runs fifteen published professional-development sessions with named trainers and institutions. They are for teaching and administrative staff; no parent workshop programme is published."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Workshops & Webinars"
    standfirst="Fifteen published sessions, with the trainer named. None of them is for parents — and this page says so."
    crumbs={[
      { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
      { label: 'Academics', href: '/academics/' },
      { label: 'Parent Partnership', href: '/academics/parent-partnership/' },
    ]}
    src={banner}
    alt="Teaching staff of Sunbeam School Ballia at a professional-development session on critical thinking in the classroom."
    position="50% 44%"
  />

  <div class="u-page-panel ac-panel">
    <AcStatement
      ground="ivory"
      ghost="15"
      ghostAt="right"
      kicker="Who the sessions are for"
      statement="Fifteen sessions.<br /><em>None for parents.</em>"
      body={[
        'Sunbeam Ballia runs one of the better-documented professional-development programmes a district school publishes: <strong>fifteen sessions</strong>, eleven of which name the trainer and eight of which name the institution they came from.',
        'Every one of them is for <strong>teaching and administrative staff</strong>. The school has not published a workshop or webinar programme for parents — no session, no format, no date. Rather than describe one, this page shows what actually runs, because a parent choosing a school is entitled to know how its teachers are trained.',
        'If a parent programme exists, it is worth publishing: it is a subject on which almost no school in the district can show anything at all.',
      ]}
    />

    <AcCollage
      ground="sand"
      side="left"
      kicker="What is actually run"
      heading="Named trainers,<br /><em>named institutions</em>"
      body={[
        'A school can claim professional development in one sentence. Sunbeam publishes the trainer, where they came from and — where it has one — the date. The list below is a selection; the full fifteen sit under News &amp; Events.',
        'The last line is the one worth pausing on. The school has also <em>delivered</em> National Education Policy training at another school, rather than only receiving it.',
      ]}
      ledger={[
        { k: 'CBSE Capacity Building · Experiential Learning', v: 'Two days hosted at Ballia, 20–21 September 2025 — Dr. Pushkal Giri, Principal of St. Joseph’s School, Siwan, and Dr. Ravishankar Mishra, Vice Principal, Heritage International Public School, Kushinagar.' },
        { k: 'Basic Counseling Skills', v: 'A two-day training with a closing assessment and viva — Mrs. Salony Priya, Founder Director, Ummeed Counselling &amp; Consulting Services, Kolkata.' },
        { k: 'Critical Thinking', v: 'Prof. Pradeep Mishra, Lovely Professional University.' },
        { k: 'Teacher–Student Bond', v: '“Teaching to Mentorship” — Mr. Kartik Bajoria, on trust, empathy and guiding students beyond academics.' },
        { k: 'AI Masterclass', v: 'Mr. Sandeep Mukherjee, Chief Operating Officer of the Sunbeam Group, on AI tools in teaching.' },
        { k: 'EduCarnival 2025 · IIT Delhi', v: 'Four of the school’s academic heads attended the 16th Eduexcellence international conference.' },
        { k: 'National Education Policy', v: '<strong>Delivered by</strong> a Sunbeam Ballia educator at Sunshine Public School, Ghazipur — not received by the school.' },
      ]}
      lead={{ src: pStory, alt: `Teaching staff of ${school} at a professional-development session on storytelling as pedagogy` }}
      support={[
        { src: pCritical, alt: `Teaching staff of ${school} at a session on teaching critical thinking in the classroom` },
        { src: pNep, alt: `A National Education Policy training session involving staff of ${school}` },
      ]}
    />

    <AcClose
      owed={true}
      statement="Trained in public.<br /><em>For staff.</em>"
      body="The school publishes fifteen staff development sessions with trainers and institutions named. It publishes no workshop or webinar programme for parents — so none is described on this page."
      photo={pCohort}
      alt={`Students and staff of ${school} gathered on the hall stage`}
      position="50% 42%"
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  div.ac-panel { padding-block: 0; }
</style>
